&lt;p&gt;I started JeanClawd because I wanted to find out how far “vibe coding” could take me.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was also interested in a more practical question: how much of a useful home assistant can
run on hardware I actually own? I like working within constraints, and I have been increasingly
interested in running some smaller models on an ESP32 or Raspberry PI.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>